<title>USA: Mackie Designs names new COO.</title>
<headline>Mackie Designs names new COO.</headline>
<dateline>WOODINVILLE, Wash. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mackie Designs Inc Monday said it named Stephen Ripp to the post of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, Mackie said Ripp was most recently president and chief executive of Corimon SACA's Major Paint Co.</p>
